{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the creators of beloved cult-classic videogames including <i>Moon: Remix RPG Adventure</i>, <i>Chulip</i>, and <i>Rule of Rose</i>, comes <i>Stray Children</i>: a bittersweet fairy tale adventure that will change the way you think about \u201cchildren\u201d and \u201cadults\u201d.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/cd1dcad9c8fa9c0f197707f0b2ec847f.avif?t=1773016266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras_big/cd1dcad9c8fa9c0f197707f0b2ec847f.avif?t=1773016266 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you do if all the adults you know suddenly started attacking you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of children who try to survive and thrive in a world just like this, every day of their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/5c276b5de2ed006ca15cf520cc8fe8f1.poster.avif?t=1773016266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/5c276b5de2ed006ca15cf520cc8fe8f1.webm?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/5c276b5de2ed006ca15cf520cc8fe8f1.mp4?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere, in our world, there\u2019s a secret room, in a secret place, filled top to bottom with ancient technology.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When one young boy flips the switch on a curious old console, they\u2019re suddenly whisked away, through the screen, into a very strange somewhere else: a long-since forgotten role playing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/382ec568fba8629ae4867c5f31fdb07a.poster.avif?t=1773016266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/382ec568fba8629ae4867c5f31fdb07a.webm?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/382ec568fba8629ae4867c5f31fdb07a.mp4?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blinking awake in this peculiar new place, they find themselves in a land of children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside this stronghold\u2019s walls lurk The Olders: monstrous adults, carrying the heavy load of their own inadequacies, self-doubt, and all of the grievances that grown-ups gather.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that these creatures are starving for something, and that \u2014 out there \u2014 no one and nowhere is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive in this world where half-crazed adults lurk around every corner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s here \u2014 in this funny, mysterious, and wildly dangerous domain \u2014 that your story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/20ff65e0dc742f4bb31902e15644c073.avif?t=1773016266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras_big/20ff65e0dc742f4bb31902e15644c073.avif?t=1773016266 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the world of <i>Stray Children</i>, you\u2019ll do turn-based battle with these oddball Olders, where you can choose to fearlessly fight or use your words as weapons, landing a crushing blow with just a well-worded whisper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.poster.avif?t=1773016266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.webm?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.mp4?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deftly dodge the relentless barrage of their bottled-up emotions, and discover the source of their strange stories. By touching their heart with your words, you might just be able to save their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.poster.avif?t=1773016266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.webm?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.mp4?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What other mysteries await you in this weird new world? Find out in <i>Stray Children</i> \u2014 an unfamiliar place, with all-too-familiar troubles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/978e0b1f7ce2f3b1ffdd96a7bd3a47ed.avif?t=1773016266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras_big/978e0b1f7ce2f3b1ffdd96a7bd3a47ed.avif?t=1773016266 width=800 height=88 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you\u2019ll have fun discovering all the secrets of <i>Stray Children</i>, but we have one final request for anyone and everyone who finishes the game: <strong><i>please keep the ending a secret</i></strong>!\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Campfire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/d54bc594600a64611ab18b2d254a643766769413.jpg"},{"name":"Experience with the Olders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/cabe4c73afc4fb229714ecf6224c09916dd2c105.jpg"},{"name":"The Patient Man is Gone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/9aaaeea78cadbf7a5a858dca917587de971bac46.jpg"},{"name":"Little Accomplice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/e087a914085e9b2fcc337c171924f144a1227554.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/9b9b76c1481e9a340d12d5fec9a1a386d5c4dea7.jpg"},{"name":"Time to Thaw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/9e62d2ef6f9c955d857278496f36bb2876490cf4.jpg"},{"name":"Where the Sky is Close","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/9cdb31cea1f5594ba1101a0d20723e4ea0fd6c22.jpg"},{"name":"Final Croak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/f65fd27bad0dccf76be5ae23c84a305df4fae8df.jpg"},{"name":"A Man\u2019s Hideout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/c62d3b804d4e6151f486708100a65c7b5a4f6324.jpg"},{"name":"Good bye, Circus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649490/093ee2c30b62de633dc24c73806d30c63a2b1236.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649490?t=1773016266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/ad39c36a9af2a6014fd501f355d5f7b22e128efb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773016266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/581976f0e723843b1c24444e1729b9f85c7bf208/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773016266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/581976f0e723843b1c24444e1729b9f85c7bf208/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773016266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the creators of beloved cult-classic videogames including <i>Moon: Remix RPG Adventure</i>, <i>Chulip</i>, and <i>Rule of Rose</i>, comes <i>Stray Children</i>: a bittersweet fairy tale adventure that will change the way you think about \u201cchildren\u201d and \u201cadults\u201d.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/cd1dcad9c8fa9c0f197707f0b2ec847f.avif?t=1773016266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras_big/cd1dcad9c8fa9c0f197707f0b2ec847f.avif?t=1773016266 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you do if all the adults you know suddenly started attacking you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of children who try to survive and thrive in a world just like this, every day of their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/5c276b5de2ed006ca15cf520cc8fe8f1.poster.avif?t=1773016266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/5c276b5de2ed006ca15cf520cc8fe8f1.webm?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/5c276b5de2ed006ca15cf520cc8fe8f1.mp4?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere, in our world, there\u2019s a secret room, in a secret place, filled top to bottom with ancient technology.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When one young boy flips the switch on a curious old console, they\u2019re suddenly whisked away, through the screen, into a very strange somewhere else: a long-since forgotten role playing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/382ec568fba8629ae4867c5f31fdb07a.poster.avif?t=1773016266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/382ec568fba8629ae4867c5f31fdb07a.webm?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/382ec568fba8629ae4867c5f31fdb07a.mp4?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blinking awake in this peculiar new place, they find themselves in a land of children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside this stronghold\u2019s walls lurk The Olders: monstrous adults, carrying the heavy load of their own inadequacies, self-doubt, and all of the grievances that grown-ups gather.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that these creatures are starving for something, and that \u2014 out there \u2014 no one and nowhere is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive in this world where half-crazed adults lurk around every corner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s here \u2014 in this funny, mysterious, and wildly dangerous domain \u2014 that your story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/20ff65e0dc742f4bb31902e15644c073.avif?t=1773016266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras_big/20ff65e0dc742f4bb31902e15644c073.avif?t=1773016266 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the world of <i>Stray Children</i>, you\u2019ll do turn-based battle with these oddball Olders, where you can choose to fearlessly fight or use your words as weapons, landing a crushing blow with just a well-worded whisper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.poster.avif?t=1773016266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.webm?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.mp4?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deftly dodge the relentless barrage of their bottled-up emotions, and discover the source of their strange stories. By touching their heart with your words, you might just be able to save their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.poster.avif?t=1773016266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.webm?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.mp4?t=1773016266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What other mysteries await you in this weird new world? Find out in <i>Stray Children</i> \u2014 an unfamiliar place, with all-too-familiar troubles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/978e0b1f7ce2f3b1ffdd96a7bd3a47ed.avif?t=1773016266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras_big/978e0b1f7ce2f3b1ffdd96a7bd3a47ed.avif?t=1773016266 width=800 height=88 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you\u2019ll have fun discovering all the secrets of <i>Stray Children</i>, but we have one final request for anyone and everyone who finishes the game: <strong><i>please keep the ending a secret</i></strong>!\u00a0</p>","developers":["Onion Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"heade